  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You can use akasha to strengthen your blood and harden your internal organs. You boost your ability to resist effects that would adversely affect your health.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Con 13 or veilweaver level 1.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> You can invest essence into this feat. You gain an insight bonus on Fortitude saves equal to the invested essence.</p>\n<p>You gain 1 point of essence.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/akashic-feats#toc13\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
